verify/diff/diff.mjs — deterministic PNG pixel-diff (Kelimatör 2012, task F1)

usage: node verify/diff/diff.mjs <a.png> <b.png> <outdir>

Compares two PNGs of identical dimensions pixel by pixel over the RGB
channels. A pixel is mismatched when its Euclidean distance is > 30;
the report passes when the mismatch ratio is <= 0.02 (2.0 % of pixels)
per docs/07-verification.md §4. Writes <outdir>/report.json and
<outdir>/heatmap.png.

Exit codes:
  0  comparison completed; pass/fail is the "pass" field of report.json
  1  usage error, size mismatch, missing file, or undecodable PNG
